!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/link/invalid/an-operation-contradicting-its-endpoint-shapes-pinned-method-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/link-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §4.1, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.7"
  description: """
    `paged_get` refines the imported record type `operation` and pins `method` to `GET`, so an operation read
    against it may omit the field and may not contradict it. `list_orders` writes `POST`, and a written value at a
    FIXED field is checked against the pinned one, so the value entry is no value of `paged_get` and the schema
    does not load. The http project relies on an application's own endpoint shape constraining every operation
    built with it.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
